{
  "title": "HLH LLM Overview",
  "uid": "hlh-llm-overview",
  "description": "Unified Prometheus + Grafana for vLLM (192.168.1.13:8000) and llama.cpp (192.168.1.12:80) on hlh-docker 192.168.1.14 — Stage 2",
  "tags": ["hlh", "vllm", "llamacpp", "prometheus"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "time": { "from": "now-1h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "engine",
        "label": "Engine",
        "type": "custom",
        "hide": 0,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" },
        "options": [
          { "text": "All", "value": "$__all", "selected": true },
          { "text": "vllm", "value": "vllm" },
          { "text": "llamacpp", "value": "llamacpp" },
          { "text": "prometheus", "value": "prometheus" }
        ],
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Prometheus Up",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 4, "w": 6, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "thresholds": { "steps": [{ "color": "red", "value": 0 }, { "color": "green", "value": 1 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up{job=\"prometheus\"}", "refId": "A" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Scrape Targets Health (up)",
      "type": "table",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 18, "x": 6, "y": 0 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": {}, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "up", "format": "table", "refId": "A" }],
      "transformations": [{ "id": "organize", "options": { "includeByName": { "job": true, "instance": true, "engine": true, "Value": true }, "renameByName": { "Value": "up" } } }]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Scrape Duration (s)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 4 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [{ "expr": "scrape_duration_seconds{job=~\"$engine\"}", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{job}}/{{instance}}" }]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Engine Info / How to Verify",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 8 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### How to verify\n- **Grafana:** http://192.168.1.14:3000 (this dashboard)\n- **Prometheus (internal → host):** http://192.168.1.11:9090 or `docker exec prometheus wget -qO- http://localhost:9090/-/healthy`\n- **Prometheus targets:** `docker exec prometheus wget -qO- http://localhost:9090/api/v1/targets` — expect `health: up` for `vllm` and `llamacpp` when LXCs 112/113 are running\n- **Engines:** `curl http://192.168.1.12:80/metrics` (llama.cpp needs `--metrics` flag) and `curl http://192.168.1.13:8000/metrics` (vLLM default)\n- If targets show `no route to host` or `down`, start engines on prox01: `pct status 112; pct status 113; pct start 112; pct start 113`\n- **Scrape labels:** `engine=vllm` (113) and `engine=llamacpp` (112), filter with template variable `engine` above"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Token Throughput (tok/s) — vLLM + llama.cpp",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 12 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ops" }, "overrides": [] },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "rate(vllm:request_prompt_tokens_sum[5m]) or rate(llamacpp:prompt_tokens_seconds[5m]) or rate(process_cpu_seconds_total[5m])", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{job}} tok/s (placeholder — exact metric name varies by engine build)" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Requests — Running / Waiting",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "vllm:num_requests_running or llamacpp:requests_processing or up{job=~\"$engine\"}", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{job}} running" }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "KV Cache / Memory (placeholder — engine-specific)",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "PBFA97CFB590B2093" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 20 },
      "targets": [
        { "expr": "vllm:kv_cache_usage_perc or llamacpp:kv_cache_usage or 0", "refId": "A", "legendFormat": "{{job}} kv cache" }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
